1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,060
When a number gets stuck, Math Heroes save the day!

2
00:00:04,720 --> 00:00:05,440
Alert!

3
00:00:05,440 --> 00:00:08,740
Five take away one, and it's stuck!

4
00:00:09,440 --> 00:00:11,980
There's no room to take away one.

5
00:00:12,900 --> 00:00:14,040
Let's call a friend!

6
00:00:16,080 --> 00:00:18,020
One's friend is four!

7
00:00:18,020 --> 00:00:21,540
Add four, then take away five!

8
00:00:22,620 --> 00:00:24,460
Five take away one is four!

9
00:00:25,060 --> 00:00:26,120
Mission solved!

10
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:28,300
Another alert!

11
00:00:28,760 --> 00:00:31,640
Five take away three, and it's stuck!

12
00:00:32,620 --> 00:00:34,640
There's no room to take away three.

13
00:00:35,520 --> 00:00:36,900
Let's call a friend again!

14
00:00:36,900 --> 00:00:40,980
Three's friend is two!

15
00:00:40,980 --> 00:00:44,460
Add two, then take away five!

16
00:00:45,520 --> 00:00:47,620
Five take away three is two!

17
00:00:48,320 --> 00:00:49,660
Heroes win again!

18
00:00:51,160 --> 00:00:53,240
Every stuck number has a trick.

19
00:00:53,240 --> 00:00:58,480
Learn them all with Abacus Kids — free on the App Store and Google Play!
